nes): Implements a `pr` utility (srd110-pr R1.1, R2.1, R2.2, R2.3) that paginates text input with headers and footers. Features:\n- Flag parsing for `--length`, `--header`, `--omit-header` (-t), `--omit-pagination` (-T)\n- SIGPIPE handler installation\n- Page formatting with configurable header text, page numbers, dates\n- Support for stdin and file input\n- Default page length of 66 lines, default width of 72 characters\n\n**pr_test.go** (137 lines): Differential test suite comparing output against reference binary (`gpr`). Tests:\n- stdin handling (with/without dash)\n- header omission (short/long flags)\n- pagination control\n- custom page lengths\n- custom headers\n- combined flag scenarios\n- 18 total test cases (r2_3_stdin_no_file through r2_3_file_arg)"}],"totalDurationMs":28475,"totalTokens":34363,"totalToolUseCount":11,"usage":{"input_tokens":7,"cache_creation_input_tokens":13817,"cache_read_input_tokens":19224,"output_tokens":1315,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":13817},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[{"input_tokens":7,"output_tokens":1315,"cache_read_input_tokens":19224,"cache_creation_input_tokens":13817,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":13817,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"toolStats":{"readCount":6,"searchCount":0,"bashCount":5,"editFileCount":0,"linesAdded":0,"linesRemoved":0,"otherToolCount":0}}}
